<section id="how-it-works" class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MADE FOR EVERYDAY FARMING</span><h2>Your field companion,<br>through every season.</h2><p>Practical tools that keep your farm information and conversations connected.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><span class="feature-number">01 / ASK</span><h3>A question is a good place to start.</h3><p>Type your question or use voice input where your browser supports it. Get advice in your preferred language.</p></article><article><span class="feature-number">02 / OBSERVE</span><h3>Show what you see.</h3><p>Share a clear crop photo for AI assessment. Unclear or uncertain cases go to an officer. Photos stay private to your advisory team.</p></article><article><span class="feature-number">03 / PLAN</span><h3>Keep your season in view.</h3><p>Track crops, check district forecasts and explore scheme information from your dashboard.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="human-section"><span class="eyebrow">AI FIRST. EXPERT HELP WHEN NEEDED.</span><h2>Useful assistance.<br>Accountable advice.</h2><p>AI answers everyday farming questions directly. When it cannot reliably solve a question or assess a crop photo, the case goes automatically to an available Krushi Officer. Every question has a visible status.</p><a class="btn-primary-green" href="/Account/Register">Create your account ↗</a></section>
